# RF Games Mobile Web

Product is a **browser hub** (Kapmaca + Katla-Çiz), not React Native/Flutter, not a game directory.

## Layout
- Primary CTAs in the **lower third** on ~390px (hub picks, lobby footer, docks, game-end)
- Spacing via `--space-*` (8pt base: `--space-2`); touch floor `--touch-min` (≥44px)
- Keep `100dvh` `.app-shell` no-scroll; scroll only inside panel regions; use safe-area insets

## Identity
- Keep parchment/atelier tokens (ink, oxblood, Fraunces / Source Sans 3)
- No slate-zinc-neon SaaS, no purple dark gaming catalog, no scrapbook dashed PNG spam, no generic shadcn rewrite

## Detail
Read `.cursor/skills/rfgames-mobile-web/SKILL.md` when changing hub/lobby/dock/end layouts.
